    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloven Blade is an action-heavy platforming adventure featuring a small clan of hoofed ninja apprentices fighting to reclaim their once peaceful homeland from reptilian foes. <br><br>Master fluid combat, discover new abilities, rescue adorable creatures and uncover the ancient secrets of the Way of Hoof in a family-friendly action adventure bursting with charm and challenge!<br><br><br><strong>Fluid Combat &amp; Movement</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine fast, agile martial arts, acrobatic platforming, and versatile ninja gadgets. Easy-to-learn controls with layered depth for players to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure &amp; Exploration</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a world filled with danger, secrets, and optional challenges. Uncover hidden paths, earn rewards, and grow your skills as a Hoof clan warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic Book Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold visuals, dramatic panels, and over-the-top action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloven Blade is an action-heavy platforming adventure featuring a small clan of hoofed ninja apprentices fighting to reclaim their once peaceful homeland from reptilian foes. <br><br>Master fluid combat, discover new abilities, rescue adorable creatures and uncover the ancient secrets of the Way of Hoof in a family-friendly action adventure bursting with charm and challenge!<br><br><br><strong>Fluid Combat &amp; Movement</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine fast, agile martial arts, acrobatic platforming, and versatile ninja gadgets. Easy-to-learn controls with layered depth for players to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure &amp; Exploration</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a world filled with danger, secrets, and optional challenges. Uncover hidden paths, earn rewards, and grow your skills as a Hoof clan warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic Book Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold visuals, dramatic panels, and over-the-top action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
